  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP Denmark Tech for Democracy 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhanced understanding and collective action coalesced around 1) how digital technologies can enhance democratic institutions, processes and practice and 2) how a multi-stakeholder approach can strengthen democratic norms in the digital era, focused on global South</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Tech for Democracy 2021-2022

The primary objective of the project is stated as followed: To provide substantive and operational support, alongside other partners, to two Tech for Democracy conferences (Nov 2021 &amp; June 2022), including preparation and follow-up processes, with the overall aim of including experiences and perspectives from a range of stakeholders in the global South, with special emphasis on young people and LNOB principles.</narrative>
  </description>
